   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FSIP-FS2020                                       Forestry Strategy Implementation Promotion ProjectForestry Strategy 2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FSIP projektet st&#xF6;djer f&#xF6;rvaltning och planering av laos skogssektor med h&#xE4;nsyn till genomf&#xF6;randet av Skogsstrategin 2020 (FS2020). Projektet st&#xF6;djer &#xE4;ven n&#xE5;gra strategiska och prioriterade aktiviteter f&#xF6;r strategins genomf&#xF6;rande. Det fungerar &#xE4;ven som sekreteriat f&#xF6;r regeringens och utvecklingspartnernas gemensamma arbetsgrupp f&#xF6;r skogssektorn.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The FSIP Project is supporting forest sector management and planning with respect to the implementation of the Forestry Strategy 2020 (FS 2020), and also supporting some key strategic priority actions for FSIP implementation. The FSIP Project also serves as the secretariat for the Government-development partner Forestry Sub-Working Group (FSWG).</narrative>
  </description>
